sequenceDiagram
    participant FE
    participant CM as client-management
    participant CD as consultation-document repo
    participant DB as MongoDB

    FE->>CM: POST /:id/consultation-documents { documents: [...] }
    CM->>DB: getClientForConsultationAccess + isUserAuthorizedWithClient
    CM->>CM: free slots = cap - existing count
    alt no free slot
        CM-->>FE: 409 { message }
    else at least one free slot
        CM->>CM: accepted = first N in order, N = min(sent, free slots)
        CM->>CD: any accepted document_key already committed?
        CM->>CD: insertMany(accepted)
        CM->>DB: findOneAndUpdate(profile, $push) guarded on array size
        CM-->>FE: 201 { data: { documents } }
    end
